In iOS 27.3, iPadOS 27.3, and the other 27.3 updates, puzzles are expanding to Australian, UK, and French-Canadian <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/guide/apple-news/">Apple News</a>+ subscribers.<br/>
<br/>
<img src="https://images.macrumors.com/article-new/2025/06/apple-news-plus-emoji-game.jpg" alt="" width="2000" height="1125" class="aligncenter size-full wp-image-1005156" /><br/>
&zwnj;Apple News&zwnj;+ subscribers in Australia get access to a daily quick crossword, crossword mini, Sudoku, Quartiles, and Emoji Game. UK subscribers get the daily quick crossword, crossword mini, and Sudoku, while French-Canadian subscribers can play Quartiles and Emoji Game.<br/>
<br/>
Quartiles and Emoji Game are original Apple puzzles. Quartiles requires players to form words by combining letter tiles, and Emoji Game lets subscribers complete phrases using a selection of emoji.<br/>
<br/>
Prior to now, &zwnj;Apple News&zwnj;+ puzzles have been limited to the U.S. and English-language subscribers in Canada. The games can be accessed in the Puzzles section under the Following tab in the &zwnj;Apple News&zwnj; app in iOS 27.3 beta 2. The update will launch to the public in December.<div class="linkback">Tags: <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/guide/apple-news/">Apple News</a>, <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/guide/united-kingdom/">United Kingdom</a></div><br/>This article, &quot;<a href="https://www.macrumors.com/2026/11/16/apple-news-puzzles-expanding/">Apple News+ Puzzles Come to UK, Australia, and French Canada</a>&quot; first appeared on <a href="https://www.macrumors.com">MacRumors.com</a><br/><br/><a href="https://forums.macrumors.com/threads/apple-news-puzzles-come-to-uk-australia-and-french-canada.2494564/">Discuss this article</a> in our forums<br/><br/>